   "url": "https://x.com/STzorfas/status/2102185846266851733",
   "conversationId": "2102185846266851733",
   "text": "The below is from Dr. Oz. So wait a minute, Dr. Oz is telling us that this is more important than site – neutral payments, increasing private practice physician payment to match inflation, reducing unnecessary government regulation like MIPS,  allowing physicians to own hospitals again, or just giving patients a choice to see the physiclan of their choosing.\n\nMedicare has been paying about 16% more for laboratory services than private insurers. That needs to change.\n\nCMS plans to better align 2027 laboratory payment rates with private-sector rates — which would be estimated to save taxpayers over $1 BILLION annually once the reductions are fully phased in, lowering Medicare patients’ premium costs.\n\nProtecting Medicare means rooting out waste https://x.com/DrOzCMS/status/2102135026200764664/video/1",
   "lang": "en",
