   "url": "https://x.com/STzorfas/status/2101713224118747538",
   "conversationId": "2101713224118747538",
   "text": "BREAKING NEWS…  I’m officially on TikTok!  Follow along for updates on our efforts to make America affordable AND our ongoing War on Fraud.\n\nhttps://x.com/DrOzCMS/status/2079658077700141144/video/1\n\nIs Medicare ever going to get around to caring about patients AND doctors?\nWill Medicare meaningfully reduce government regulation and increase reimbursement to independent private-practice physicians? \nAt the rate we're going, in 5–10 years there may be very few independent doctors left.\n\nAnd this is NOT just a doctor issue.\n\nIt is very much a PATIENT issue.\n\nWhen independent doctors disappear, patients lose choice, continuity, access and—perhaps most importantly—a physician who is free to put the patient first.\n\nWe need policies that make independent medical practice viable again.  @DrOzCMS @CMSGov @WhiteHouse @SecKennedy",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-20T16:40:55.000Z",
