   "url": "https://x.com/STzorfas/status/2090221240845758968",
   "conversationId": "2090181425807135205",
   "text": "Absolutely. I have bills and huge expenses.  Why should I wait 4 weeks to get paid. Or worse, administrator plans take 6 to 8 weeks to get paid. Why am I different from anybody else? Why should I get abused by middle men all day long.  My day starts with a middleman and ends with a middleman.  I have a very small practice and I run it as efficiently as possible.",
