   "url": "https://x.com/STzorfas/status/2090217114191679667",
   "conversationId": "2090181425807135205",
   "text": "I go to a barber or electrician or Walmart or the supermarket or any freakin business on the planet and everyone gets paid at the time of service. Very few people are left in the world that don’t get paid at the time of service. Please! I should be no different. The fact that this has been going on for decades is ridiculous. You’re providing a professional service and it should be paid at the time of service.",
