   "text": "Zachary. Why settle for unionization. Take it all back!  No middlemen. That’s all there is in life anymore - there’s always a middleman. There should be nothing that stands in the way between the doctor and the patient. That includes an insurance company, a lawyer, a union, a PBM.  Should I go on?",
