   "conversationId": "2079163555216085305",
   "text": "The absolute truth.  And, see my post from today.  They will never have to deal with a MA plan bundling a payment for a procedure and having to reprocess the procedure and they subsequently take back all the money for the whole damn procedure.  They don't worry about the maintenance of a building.  They don't worry about employees or  pay for their medical insurance.  what about all the expenses for the practice such as paying rent or utilities.  Actually sitting down with your staff and sending in the MIPS requirements in August.  I'm not quite sure they pay quarterly federal and state income taxes.  I could go on and on.  But I would not trade it for a second.  Regardless how miserable Dr. Oz and the government make it for me, I am small and nimble and they can not get rid of me so fast.  I am not leaving.\nPlease join me @STzorfas.",
